{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"NOTE: This preprint reports new research that has not been certified by peer review and should not be used to guide clinical practice.\",\n    \"https://doi.org/10.1101/2022.02.08.22270370\",\n    \"doi: medRxiv preprint\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"https://doi.org/10.1101/2022.02.08.22270370\",\n    \"NOTE: This preprint reports new research that has not been certified by peer review and should not be used to guide clinical practice.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"全文明确将所附文本标识为medRxiv预印本，并明确声明该研究尚未经过同行评审，同时提供了独立的medRxiv DOI（10.1101/2022.02.08.22270370）。因此，就附件所代表的具体版本而言，报告将其描述为未经同行评审的medRxiv预印本有明确的全文依据。指控者的说法部分有依据：全文确实支持medRxiv预印本具有独立DOI这一点。但全文没有提及Science Translational Medicine，也没有提供PMID:36070366对应的正式发表版本的期刊信息、正式发表日期或出版DOI。因此，仅凭全文无法确认PMID对应的是另一个正式同行评审版本，更无法确认报告错误识别了EID实际引用的版本。不能将全文没有提供的版本对应关系当作已经证实的事实。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9375e889-e964-44c5-b446-d9d8c0e8bd30", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261114T073904962115Z", "elapsed_seconds": 134.937, "completed_utc": "2026-11-14T07:41:19.914703+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ae4f3f009a19049be9fa8e9711ad77f928df0d35da565ae2b3cad9a05a09bcba", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da